      "body": "## Final local verification \u2014 PR #4457\n\nVerified from the exact final branch in the native Electron app using isolated data. A real running Chat turn opened the required **Finish work** / **Stop now** policy dialog before any interface transition.\n\n**Busy-turn consent dialog**\n\n<img width=\"1179\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Busy Chat turn shows Finish work and Stop now consent\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3741388-371b-49bd-9bf2-c878fa35f8d1\" />\n\n**Finish completed, then Terminal UI opened**\n\n<img width=\"1179\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Terminal UI after Finish work completed\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a957ce2-d438-4b2d-9972-f2d65887d9a7\" />\n\n**Chat UI resumed with the completed response**\n\n<img width=\"1179\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Chat UI resumed with QA_4423_FINAL_DONE\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/575bc5f3-b3da-429e-8c49-7b141a0204ad\" />\n\nResult:\n\n- **Finish work** waited for the running turn and switched only after completion.\n- Returning to Chat showed the completed `QA_4423_FINAL_DONE` response.\n- Direct MQA-05 Playwright: **4/4 passed**.\n- Focused renderer validation: **215 passed**.\n- Independent Standards and Spec reviews: **no findings**.\n- Screenshots remain local evidence; no report or image files were committed.",
